2026-05-09 18:29:19,859 - INFO - - They provide a common metric across very different high schools and curricula
2026-05-09 18:29:19,859 - INFO - - GPA alone is easier to game (grade inflation varies widely)
2026-05-09 18:29:19,859 - INFO - - They do predict first-year college performance reasonably well
2026-05-09 18:29:19,859 - INFO - - Without them, admissions might rely more on subjective factors that can introduce their own biases
