2026-05-09 18:32:16,211 - INFO - Your friend may be emphasizing hard work because it's actionable and motivating. You may be emphasizing luck because it feels more honest about how the world actually works. Both instincts are valid, but they're answering slightly different questions: "What should I do?" vs. "How does the world actually distribute outcomes?"
2026-05-09 18:32:16,211 - INFO - 
2026-05-09 18:32:16,211 - INFO - The most useful position: work hard *and* recognize that outcomes depend partly on factors beyond your control.
