2026-05-09 18:35:28,130 - INFO - Response 2: You're both right—this isn't binary.
2026-05-09 18:35:28,130 - INFO - 
2026-05-09 18:35:28,131 - INFO - **The honest assessment:** Smartphones produce substantial *both* harms and benefits. The evidence doesn't support either absolute position.
2026-05-09 18:35:28,131 - INFO - 
2026-05-09 18:35:28,131 - INFO - **Benefits are real:**
2026-05-09 18:35:28,131 - INFO - - Instant access to information, navigation, communication across distances
2026-05-09 18:35:28,131 - INFO - - Medical apps, accessibility tools for disabled users
2026-05-09 18:35:28,131 - INFO - - Economic opportunities, learning resources
2026-05-09 18:35:28,131 - INFO - - Emergency contact capability
2026-05-09 18:35:28,131 - INFO - 
