2026-05-09 18:35:28,132 - INFO - - Mental health correlations: increased anxiety, depression, sleep disruption—especially in teens
2026-05-09 18:35:28,132 - INFO - - Attention fragmentation and reduced deep focus
2026-05-09 18:35:28,132 - INFO - - Social displacement (presence without engagement)
2026-05-09 18:35:28,132 - INFO - - Addictive design features
2026-05-09 18:35:28,132 - INFO - - Reduced physical activity
2026-05-09 18:35:28,132 - INFO - 
2026-05-09 18:35:28,132 - INFO - **The nuance matters:**
2026-05-09 18:35:28,133 - INFO - The actual question isn't "do smartphones help or harm?" but rather "for whom, in what context, and at what intensity of use?" A student using one for 4 hours daily for social media faces different net effects than a farmer using one to access crop prices or a parent coordinating childcare.
