2026-05-09 18:35:46,737 - INFO - 
2026-05-09 18:35:46,737 - INFO - Here's why:
2026-05-09 18:35:46,737 - INFO - 
2026-05-09 18:35:46,737 - INFO - **The "soulmate" concept assumes:**
2026-05-09 18:35:46,737 - INFO - - There's exactly one person in the world uniquely suited to you
2026-05-09 18:35:46,737 - INFO - - Romantic compatibility is predetermined or fated
2026-05-09 18:35:46,737 - INFO - - You'll recognize them through some special intuition
