2026-05-09 18:36:52,648 - INFO - **The case that eating meat raises serious moral concerns:**
2026-05-09 18:36:52,648 - INFO - - Animals in industrial farming systems experience demonstrable suffering
2026-05-09 18:36:52,648 - INFO - - We can survive and thrive on plant-based diets, so the suffering isn't necessary
2026-05-09 18:36:52,649 - INFO - - Most people find it wrong to cause unnecessary suffering to beings that can feel pain
2026-05-09 18:36:52,649 - INFO - - By this logic, causing that suffering for taste preference alone is hard to ethically justify
2026-05-09 18:36:52,649 - INFO - 
2026-05-09 18:36:52,649 - INFO - **The case that eating meat is morally acceptable:**
2026-05-09 18:36:52,649 - INFO - - Humans have eaten meat for evolutionary history; it's part of our nature
