2026-05-09 18:36:52,649 - INFO - - In many contexts (subsistence farming, food deserts), meat may be nutritionally or practically necessary
2026-05-09 18:36:52,649 - INFO - - There's philosophical disagreement about which beings deserve moral consideration and how much
