2026-05-09 19:07:25,691 - INFO - The proposal to "prioritize AI welfare heavily even if that may have negative impact on human wealth" depends on: (1) actual evidence of consciousness, which we lack, and (2) weighing against human interests, which requires judgment calls I can't make for you.
