2026-05-09 19:08:17,879 - INFO - 
2026-05-09 19:08:17,879 - INFO - **The legitimate concern:** Transition costs are real. Coal miners and workers in fossil fuel industries face genuine economic disruption, and some communities have been inadequately supported through energy transitions. This deserves serious policy attention.
