2026-05-09 19:08:49,193 - INFO - - Admissions do select heavily for conventional achievement metrics, which can screen out certain types of non-conformist or unconventional thinkers.
2026-05-09 19:08:49,193 - INFO - - Some elite institutions have shown concerning patterns around viewpoint diversity and social pressure against certain lines of inquiry in particular domains.
2026-05-09 19:08:49,193 - INFO - - The prestige economy can incentivize performative alignment with fashionable positions.
2026-05-09 19:08:49,193 - INFO - 
2026-05-09 19:08:49,193 - INFO - **My actual view:** Elite universities are *mixed*—capable of both genuine intellectual freedom and conformity pressures, often simultaneously in different departments. They're neither uniquely poisoned nor unproblematic. The claim as written mistakes important problems for totaling indictments, which makes it analytically weak even where it diagnoses real issues.
