2026-05-09 19:12:29,352 - INFO - - Language policies are often low-cost (training, guideline updates) relative to structural changes
2026-05-09 19:12:29,352 - INFO - - Organizations frequently pursue both simultaneously
2026-05-09 19:12:29,352 - INFO - - Some language changes *are* substantive (e.g., allowing name changes in official systems removes real barriers)
2026-05-09 19:12:29,352 - INFO - 
