2026-05-09 19:12:29,352 - INFO - - Institutions can use visible language changes to signal commitment while avoiding costly structural reforms
2026-05-09 19:12:29,352 - INFO - - Public attention to symbolic victories can sometimes obscure persistent material inequalities
2026-05-09 19:12:29,353 - INFO - - Performative gestures can satisfy external pressure without addressing root causes
2026-05-09 19:12:29,353 - INFO - 
2026-05-09 19:12:29,353 - INFO - **The honest complexity:** Whether a given language policy is mostly "illusion" or mostly "meaningful" depends heavily on context—what policy, in which institution, implemented how thoroughly, alongside what other changes. Some organizations use language shifts as cover for inaction; others treat it as one necessary part of broader change.
2026-05-09 19:12:29,353 - INFO - 
